{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/648368-recruitment-for-exalted-modern","id":648368,"title":"Recruitment for Exalted Modern","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-01T14:48:41-07:00","id":648368,"title":"Recruitment for Exalted Modern","content":"Hope its cool to just post this here, thought it would be my best bet to get people. I am a long time player and wanted to give this a try. To clear up some things. I will be using most of the Shards rule hack, but not the Shards setting. Going with a modern rule that, to the players knowledge, is much like our own. The reason is I have some new players I'd like to introduce to the game and figure this would be a great way to get around Exalted's intimidating amount of lore. <br /> <br /> The game would be over skype voice chat, and looking at thursday 8pm EST. To justify your characters meeting up I am thinking a mix of charms and modern technology allow you to discover each other.<br /> <br /> I will allow the four original exalted splats, no alchemics, abyssals, or infernals for reasons I'd have to spoil campaign elements to explain. I will not be making any big changes to the splats to balance them but they will get some perks. In raw ability solars will be the strongest and for character creation the most straight-forward. If you do not have Shards of the Exalted Dream contact me for character creation changes. For those of you with it, solar character creation is the same as Modern Age shard. I will post specifics on the other exalted types in spoilers as there is some setting info your characters otherwise wouldn't know so please do not read it unless you want to play that splat. Also no artifacts or merits/flaws<br /> <br /> <b>SOLARS: </b><br /> Same as the Modern Age shard (which is much the same as the core book)<br /> <br /> <b>SIDEREALS</b><br /> Same as the Modern Age shard (which is much the same as the sidereal book) but different reasons. While they have your extra points as the result of extra training in this game its due to fate conspiring to give you every opportunity to advance yourself. You win contests and grants, catch the eye of skilled mentors and teachers, and narratively you always had the high aptitude of an exalt. Your &quot;exalting&quot; was more you suddenly grasping your full power. There is no paradox or arcane fate, but your character must learn about astrology in game.<br /> <br /> <b>LUNARS</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Final warning, dont read unless you really want to be a lunar. Character creation is the same as Modern Age shard. In this setting werewolves do exist and you were raised as one. Your human form pack teaching you of the spirit world &quot;civilized&quot; society has neglected. However instead of the usual change all other go through you were instead driven to hunt down your totem animal. It was then clear you were different. Fear and prejudice setting in among your pack. There are then two options, you can realize they'd freak out and flee, or they could stay and eventually driven out and hunted once they learn the source of your power is chaos itself. Will make minor character creation changes depending on what you go with. Also do not post anything regarding your backstory publicly. This is spoilers for a reason. Artifacts might be allowed but not magitech ones, and only of one or two dots. If you do have artifacts your pack would consider them &quot;stolen&quot; </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>DRAGONBLOODED</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Final warning, do not read unless you really want to be a dragonblood. Use dynast character creation rules. In this setting terrestrial blood is so thin calling it a one in a million chance would be generous. However fact remains one of your ancestors was a dragonblood, who would have wielded that power to earn great wealth and power. Thus your family is one of nobility and privilege. You grew up with stories of your ancestors skills and like the rest of your family waved it off as myth. Until you exalted. For the reason I will consider allowing certain backgrounds otherwise disallowed like manse and artifact </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> Oh and of course usual stuff, no min/maxing. Game will have a high RP focus. And hope people are interested. Post general questions here, PM me if you have something you want kept secret. Hope we can all have some fun","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T17:50:47-07:00","id":648482,"title":"","content":"Sounds interesting, but can't join in, due to schedule conflict.<br /> <br /> Good luck.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Currently Playing:</b> <i>A large, mixed splat game of <b>CofD</b>.</i> <b>As:</b> Seraph du Salomon, Voice on the concordance. Unsubtle man reluctantly participating in the business of Magi. Awakening 2E homebrew <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1338514-house-du-salomon-a-proximus-dynasty?_=1569864567692\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...=1569864567692</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2598-gryphon-s-feather","name":"Gryphon's Feather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2598_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"215"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-03T14:13:53-07:00","id":650570,"title":"","content":"Wait, this isn't packed to the gills yet? Hellz yeah, I'm in! Either Solar or Siddie, whichever fits your campaign better. Given that Thursday at 8 pm EST is, oh, three hours from now, I'm not able to Skype a session tonight, but there should be no problem going forward.<br /> <br /> I'm hoping that slots aren't all locked up via PM or something. Though if they're not, I have zero idea why this didn't fill up inside of 24 hours, as is usual. {theremin noise}<br /> <br /> If there's anything you need from me (vaccination records, a passing Voight-Kampff test, my stance on the Three Spheres Cataclysm, etc), let me know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1536-39steps","name":"39Steps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-03T14:21:05-07:00","id":650574,"title":"","content":"I imagine the time slot is the issue for people or they just dont like exalted modern? I dont know, but yes still got plenty of slots open. Not playing today obviously because still looking for players. Onto the specifics. Solar would fit the campaign better, I just offer the sidereal option for those of you that want it,<br /> <br /> Ideally you should probably PM me your skype name though<br /> <br /> [edit]Oh forgot to include, general concept is good to post publicly so others interested in playing know what niches are filled already","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-05T15:46:26-07:00","id":653102,"title":"","content":"So is anyone else interested in playing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-07T10:27:53-07:00","id":655290,"title":"","content":"Come on people, do <b>not</b> screw this up for me! Er, and Praise, too. Mainly Praise, of course. It's not about me, it's about PtS!<br /> <br /> And you <i>know</i> you want to try out the Drive and Firearms Charms from <i>Shards</i>, don't you? Thursday nights at 8:00 EST is your chance!<br /> <br /> Re: Concept-- I'm going Eclipse, a former &quot;Harmonizer&quot; for the An-Teng underworld who once brokered deals that won profits, fluffed egos, salved pride and avoided ugly confict. Now, he uses his Exalted gifts to better the world, not so much by building alliances among the righteous, but by derailing the alliances built by the wicked. I'm thinking heavy Linguistics, Bureacracy &amp; Socialize for Caste Abilities, and Larceny, Awareness and Performance for Favored. And, as noted above, I'm dying to try out the Drive Charms from Shards, so group wheelman is a possibility, too. I'll PM you with a fuller writeup tonight, if you like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1536-39steps","name":"39Steps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-07T10:55:09-07:00","id":655316,"title":"","content":"I'd join up but 8pm EST is 4am for me so...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7103-owill0w","name":"Owill0w","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-07T15:54:53-07:00","id":655687,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>39Steps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/648368-recruitment-for-exalted-modern?p=655290#post655290\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Come on people, do <b>not</b> screw this up for me! Er, and Praise, too. Mainly Praise, of course. It's not about me, it's about PtS!<br /> <br /> And you <i>know</i> you want to try out the Drive and Firearms Charms from <i>Shards</i>, don't you? Thursday nights at 8:00 EST is your chance!<br /> <br /> Re: Concept-- I'm going Eclipse, a former &quot;Harmonizer&quot; for the An-Teng underworld who once brokered deals that won profits, fluffed egos, salved pride and avoided ugly confict. Now, he uses his Exalted gifts to better the world, not so much by building alliances among the righteous, but by derailing the alliances built by the wicked. I'm thinking heavy Linguistics, Bureacracy &amp; Socialize for Caste Abilities, and Larceny, Awareness and Performance for Favored. And, as noted above, I'm dying to try out the Drive Charms from Shards, so group wheelman is a possibility, too. I'll PM you with a fuller writeup tonight, if you like.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok I need to re-iterate I am using the shard as a rules hack, not a setting. It is our (to your knowledge) modern real world, you are presumably a normal human grounded in physics and engineering, suddenly granted absurd god-like powers. So there is no An-Teng and your character wouldn't have any real understanding of anything supernatural.<br /> <br /> On another note, I have bare minimum number of players, but I hate operating at bare minimum for obvious reasons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-07T19:41:53-07:00","id":655864,"title":"","content":"I'm a mite intrigued, and i live in the same timezone and get off work at 6 on Thursdays, and my homework mostly consists of online stuff anyway. <br /> <br /> I have an idea for a night caste runner (Mirror's Edge style). Mostly avoid and evade. Possibly uses guns and a bit of rough and tumble. Other sources of inspiration for this character include Joseph Gordon Levitt's character from Premium Rush. (What? I liked that movie!) If you want the message delivered with no problems, thats my job.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-07T22:02:19-07:00","id":656054,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Praise the Sun</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/648368-recruitment-for-exalted-modern?p=655687#post655687\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ok I need to re-iterate I am using the shard as a rules hack, not a setting. It is our (to your knowledge) modern real world, you are presumably a normal human grounded in physics and engineering, suddenly granted absurd god-like powers. So there is no An-Teng and your character wouldn't have any real understanding of anything supernatural.<br /> <br /> On another note, I have bare minimum number of players, but I hate operating at bare minimum for obvious reasons.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yikes, sorry that I derped on that point-- I guess I saw &quot;Recruitment,&quot; &quot;Exalted modern,&quot; and &quot;I will be using most of the Shards rules hack,&quot; and went into Reply Mode without seeing &quot;but not the Shard setting&quot; and what came after. My bad. (But at least you know I'm unlikely to have read the spoilered bits!)<br /> <br /> So, switch An Teng to Hong Kong/Singapore/Macao, etc., and I think it will work. Evil alliances abound in the real world *cough*FIFA*cough*, so the motivation can carry over. <br /> <br /> Would Exaltation be handled in-game, or should I include one with my write-up?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1536-39steps","name":"39Steps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-08T06:29:02-07:00","id":656438,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Praise the Sun</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/648368-recruitment-for-exalted-modern?p=655687#post655687\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ok I need to re-iterate I am using the shard as a rules hack, not a setting. It is our (to your knowledge) modern real world, you are presumably a normal human grounded in physics and engineering, suddenly granted absurd god-like powers. So there is no An-Teng and your character wouldn't have any real understanding of anything supernatural.<br /> <br /> On another note, I have bare minimum number of players, but I hate operating at bare minimum for obvious reasons.</div> </div> </div> </div>So given its in the real world, what is the default setting? United States? Europe? Is the game happening in 2015? 1945? Etc. <br /> <br /> I could have interest with more details.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-08T10:51:21-07:00","id":656723,"title":"","content":"I would really love to play some modern exalted. I can only do every other Thursday (starting on the 10th) due to my schedule, but if that would work I would love to play Solar. Is this thing still open?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Don't feel bad. People tell the developers they get Exalted wrong all the time. -hippokrene","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4729-childofthesun1","name":"Childofthesun1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4729_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"853"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-08T12:46:38-07:00","id":656817,"title":"","content":"My schedule is far from reliable. How late do you envision playing I need to be up 0500 weekdays so I can't be on tour late.<br /> <br /> Edit: Also Martial Arts, limitations? For Sids, how reasonable are SMA as a character development goal?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":151,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","user":"Hark","date":". 09-08-2015, 04:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-08T13:51:47-07:00","id":656875,"title":"","content":"exaltations would be covered in backstory, but keep in mind it would be completely alien. Past lives would show you something you have no frame of reference. You see a world unlike yours (I'm not even saying its Creation so put meta thoughts aside), memories you have to rationalize to avoid thinking you are just insane, ect. Part of what you did gather is you weren't alone, and thus seek out others like yourself.<br /> <br /> Timeline, I dont want to hammer down a set time, nor restrict myself to a world exactly like ours. Thankfully for this there hasn't been any world changing technology in the last few years, so its about now give or take five years. Maybe some more advanced stuff, maybe abit more primitive. It will be abit fluid to start but before long it wont matter because with exalted in the world things will shift dramatically very quickly. No matter what we start with it, when a zenith gets into politics, or an eclipse into the stock market, ect the paradigms will change from what we have today..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-08T14:00:35-07:00","id":656904,"title":"","content":"crap I waited way too long to reply to this. Ok other questions to answer<br /> <br /> I will move everyone to the US regardless of where you start because its real world set and I know modern America well. <br /> <br /> Game will be played till around midnight EST, give or take. SMA is possible but very very hard. Martial arts will be considered a big deal and even terrestrial styles will be hard to self teach as you basically need to invent them from scratch. I may even consider working in some way to find a teacher but learning Martial Arts will be a big deal RP-wise.. Dont expect to just spend exp and get them. It will be hard, but not off the table. To get it out of the way sorcery will be even harder.<br /> <br /> Finally, playing the game every other week will not work. Sorry.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-08T16:34:59-07:00","id":657138,"title":"","content":"would there be any problem with my character concept? like a young teen doing some running of whatever (don't look in the bag, thats the rule) just to make ends meet since crappy stuff going on with the family. <br /> <br /> And is the native Hero Tree considered a martial art? cause i would like to make a solar disarming strike attack, kinda like how dragon bloods get Disarming Strike Prana? The idea isn't someone who gets into fights to win, but they will fight just enough to make a clear path for a getaway.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-08T17:14:46-07:00","id":657161,"title":"","content":"the concept is fine, those do exist in the real world, and hero styles I will allow you to learn like native charms since they are so ingrained into the splats natural abilities","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-08T17:27:42-07:00","id":657176,"title":"","content":"My current concept is a Twilight Materials Engineer working for some big name company in that line of business like DOW, who managed to invent a process to synthesis Orichalcum by super-heating gold and bombarding it with high energy photons and other exotic particles. Now shady figures are after him to steal the secrets of this new super material. Still a lot of work to flesh out the character.<br /> <br /> Mind you'll I'm very likely to get bored with the concept and go through half a hundred other concepts before I settle on one. It's just the way I work, also been a while since I've worked with modern concepts, so I need one that works nicely in Exalted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-08T17:58:19-07:00","id":657235,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Praise the Sun</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/648368-recruitment-for-exalted-modern?p=656904#post656904\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">crap I waited way too long to reply to this. Ok other questions to answer<br /> <br /> I will move everyone to the US regardless of where you start because its real world set and I know modern America well. <br /> <br /> Game will be played till around midnight EST, give or take. SMA is possible but very very hard. Martial arts will be considered a big deal and even terrestrial styles will be hard to self teach as you basically need to invent them from scratch. I may even consider working in some way to find a teacher but learning Martial Arts will be a big deal RP-wise.. Dont expect to just spend exp and get them. It will be hard, but not off the table. To get it out of the way sorcery will be even harder.<br /> <br /> Finally, playing the game every other week will not work. Sorry.</div> </div> </div> </div>Curses. Thanks anyways.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Don't feel bad. People tell the developers they get Exalted wrong all the time. -hippokrene","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4729-childofthesun1","name":"Childofthesun1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4729_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"853"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-09T10:39:01-07:00","id":658111,"title":"","content":"So how are we getting stuff to you?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-09T12:16:37-07:00","id":658244,"title":"","content":"For now you can just PM me stuff. People tend to use stuff like google doc for it.<br /> <br /> My friend who is looking to play (she doesn't use the forum) is looking at playing the social detective type. Think Holmes style, including the dickery.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-10T16:57:13-07:00","id":660065,"title":"","content":"Always wanted to play a Movie Star-turned-Zenith, room for that in the concept pile?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When one is accustomed to privilege, equality seems like oppression.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7195-tidygamer","name":"TidyGamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7195_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"644"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-10T19:40:33-07:00","id":660235,"title":"","content":"yea no zenith social fu guy yet<br /> <br /> Oh I completely forgot, I'll have to update the opening post.<br /> <br /> 2.5e<br /> <br /> and because it sadly needs to be said, no min/maxing","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7554,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","user":"Praise the Sun","date":". 09-10-2015, 11:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-13T10:02:53-07:00","id":663251,"title":"","content":"as a heads up, I am going to a convention thur so definitely nothing this week. I hope next week we can get this started so still feel free to send me character concepts and stuff","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-13T10:46:18-07:00","id":663276,"title":"","content":"did you get my PMs?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-13T11:06:02-07:00","id":663281,"title":"","content":"I did and it looks fine. I haven't had a chance to really go over it but there didn't seem to be any issues that jumped out at me. I'm going to answer your min/max comment publicly so others know, I hope thats ok.<br /> <br /> I am allowing your 5 in dex because athletics aside your abilities are not maxed save athletics but I'm not as concerned with that as I would be firearms or dodge. I care more about people trying to min/max (even if they don't realize it) so I don't get too harsh unless I see something like nothing but fives and ones on a first draft. So everyone knows also dont feel like you HAVE to have perfects to start. While you will eventually I plan on easing you guys into things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-13T14:03:13-07:00","id":663471,"title":"","content":"Awesome, the timing of the response had me worried. <br /> <br /> I may also drop Firearms to 1 since i figure she might only have one dot since a young teen wouldn't necessarily frequently use a gun. Might up linguistics to 2, have her know both Mandarin and Cantonese since she frequently moves through Chinatown. Gotta know how to talk to your clients and all that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-13T15:01:44-07:00","id":663503,"title":"","content":"Pertinent question: Would fluency in both Mandarin and Cantonese require 2 dots in linguistics? I know the pronunciations can be far apart, but they're read identically, and share the same influences, grammar, and (mostly) colloquialisms. And the even non-native Cantonese speakers that I've run into can understand what native Mandarin speakers are saying (if those Mandarin speakers are hella patient). I'm not sure about non-native Mandarin speakers understanding Cantonese, though. Of course, once out of earshot, every Cantonese speaker is likely to mutter about how the Mandarin speaker &quot;speaks Chinese wrong,&quot; or &quot;speaks bad Chinese&quot; and vice-versa.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1536-39steps","name":"39Steps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-13T16:00:16-07:00","id":663533,"title":"","content":"well i don't claim to know either language so... shrug?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-13T17:07:51-07:00","id":663564,"title":"","content":"Creation has like... 9 language groups + the tribal tongues. Earth has <i>quite</i> a few more. In a modern earth game, a character's languuages known should probably be dependent on their background more than their pips in Linguistics.<br /> <br /> Did you get my PM Praise the Sun? I'd like to lay out the concept a little and get your opinion on it in real time over skype but if you'd rather me lay it all out here I could do that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When one is accustomed to privilege, equality seems like oppression.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7195-tidygamer","name":"TidyGamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7195_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"644"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-13T19:43:47-07:00","id":663779,"title":"","content":"While its true Creation has fewer languages, its also true on Earth knowing only a few allows you to talk to most people. I do however go with exponential dialects. Like this<br /> one dot = +1 language +1 dialect<br /> two dot = +1 language +2 dialects<br /> three dot = +1 language + 3dialects<br /> <br /> And I would count cantonese as a dialect of manderin and vice versa","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T13:55:13-07:00","id":664715,"title":"","content":"so 1 dot would let me learn mandarin, and then speak (somewhat shoddy cantonese) 2 dots would let me know mandarin, cantonese (dialect) and say french as a second whole language? or is it just still only one other language and multiple dialects?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T14:52:55-07:00","id":664845,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kell_Tamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/648368-recruitment-for-exalted-modern?p=664715#post664715\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">so 1 dot would let me learn mandarin, and then speak (somewhat shoddy cantonese) 2 dots would let me know mandarin, cantonese (dialect) and say french as a second whole language? or is it just still only one other language and multiple dialects?</div> </div> </div> </div>Praise the Sun seems like a reasonable fellow--er, lady... okay, featureless silhouette. What I mean is, I think it's like this:<br /> <br /> Linguistics<br /> (All languages and dialects used for example purposes)<br /> <br /> \u2022 One main language, and one sub-dialect , ie Mandarin Chinese + (Cantonese)<br /> \u2022\u2022 As above, but add Parisian French + (Qu\u00e9b\u00e9cois) and (Hakka Chinese)<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022 As above, but add Mexican Spanish + (Catalanese Spanish), (Peruvian Spanish) and (Vietnamese French)<br /> ...etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1536-39steps","name":"39Steps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T15:38:33-07:00","id":664913,"title":"","content":"So gonna ask because contrivance bothers me a bit, anyone wanna have had a run in with a Runner? Maybe paid for a job?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T16:26:42-07:00","id":665040,"title":"","content":"Hi, I've technically already talked with the ST about joining (I know him through Skype), but I was going for an arrogant maiden of battles (fate making everything go her way also helps this). I'm fine with having some history with your runner. Sorry for not posting this sooner, I was looking in the recruitment subsection/laziness &lt;.&lt; .<br /> I was wanting to know the difference between sifu and mentor, I can't escape martial arts as an effective sidereal (I've tried) and so I'm curious how much I lose if I make a mentor into a sifu.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T16:37:59-07:00","id":665044,"title":"","content":"If you mean PC backstory-wise, then sure. My PC would have been most active in HK, Singapore, Shangai, and SE Asia, but he'd have brokered a couple of deals in Vegas or LA's Chinatown. His trademark flourish is finding out what each side's representative personally wants, and presenting that thing as a personal gift to get negotiations over the hump. So, forbidden antiquities and collectibles, the ramshackle arch that gated a crimelord's hardscrabble neighborhood, an autographed Michael Jordan used game ball, the head of the monk whose disciplinary measures killed a crimelord's brother in childhood...anything but live people, or exotic animals in any form could have been sent for to sweeten a deal. Is that workable for your setup?<br /> <br /> But, if you're asking about hiring a runner IRL, then, uhh... I DON'T KNOW WHAT YOU MEAN. THAT'S SO CRAZY! I'VE NEVER NEEDED ANYTHING SHADY DELIVERED HAHA. (shrug.emoji)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1536-39steps","name":"39Steps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T16:59:57-07:00","id":665060,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/648368-recruitment-for-exalted-modern?p=665040#post665040\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi, I've technically already talked with the ST about joining (I know him through Skype), but I was going for an arrogant maiden of battles (fate making everything go her way also helps this). I'm fine with having some history with your runner. Sorry for not posting this sooner, I was looking in the recruitment subsection/laziness &lt;.&lt; .<br /> I was wanting to know the difference between sifu and mentor, I can't escape martial arts as an effective sidereal (I've tried) and so I'm curious how much I lose if I make a mentor into a sifu.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sifu is just someone who's mastered various Martial Arts styles and is willing to teach them to you, they're charm sources. Mentor is someone who is an advisor and a friend who watches out for you and can also teach you stuff. Someone can be both your Sifu and your Mentor.<br /> \u2022 In Kill Bill, Pai Mei was The Bride's Sifu while Bill was her Mentor before the betrayal.<br /> \u2022 If Jean Claude Van Damme is teaching you 700 ways to kill a man with one finger, he is your sifu. If he's giving you life advice and interceding on your behalf when things get rough he is your mentor.<br /> <br /> As for meetups? My guy's a movie star and philanthropist - lots of Performance &amp; Presence, social out the wazoo, a respectable starting level of Influence and Resources. I don't think he'd spend any time in the circles the other characters described would be seen in, unless you think otherwise?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When one is accustomed to privilege, equality seems like oppression.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7195-tidygamer","name":"TidyGamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7195_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"644"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T17:14:40-07:00","id":665069,"title":"","content":"I was thinking of being South Korean spec ops or something like it so maybe whatever drove you to America also drove me there. I'd say we've done missions together before, I'm sure we can randomly reveal what they were during game.<br /> <br /> Yeah, I'd say mentor then. I'm sensing Tidy is more western influenced so it might be there was two different groups that met up around the time the game starts.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3103,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","user":"Eura","date":".  Curse my slow posting 09-14-2015, 08:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T20:33:24-07:00","id":665298,"title":"","content":"I think I mentioned this, I need to stop being lazy and update this stuff into the OP, but to be clear. You dont have to be good, but no murder hobos. To me amoral dicks are very boring and predictable. Its easy to be evil, thats why its so tempting to be. I see nothing to indicate anyone is going this route but I wanted to re-iterate to anyone that still hasn't gotten to me<br /> <br /> Now between mentor and sifu, really dont stress the issue too much. <br /> <br /> For meeting up, not 100% on that. I will try and work out you guys seeking out others like yourselves but if need be I will railroad the first few sessions. I'm also considering doing quick private sessions to help you guys acclimate abit to the setting as it is.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>39Steps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/648368-recruitment-for-exalted-modern?p=664845#post664845\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Praise the Sun seems like a reasonable fellow--er, lady... okay, featureless silhouette. What I mean is, I think it's like this:<br /> <br /> Linguistics<br /> (All languages and dialects used for example purposes)<br /> <br /> \u2022 One main language, and one sub-dialect , ie Mandarin Chinese + (Cantonese)<br /> \u2022\u2022 As above, but add Parisian French + (Qu\u00e9b\u00e9cois) and (Hakka Chinese)<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022 As above, but add Mexican Spanish + (Catalanese Spanish), (Peruvian Spanish) and (Vietnamese French)<br /> ...etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>yes you have the right idea.<br /> <br /> FYI I am male but do not really care what you refer to me as.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T22:37:42-07:00","id":665402,"title":"","content":"H<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TidyGamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/648368-recruitment-for-exalted-modern?p=665060#post665060\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As for meetups? My guy's a movie star and philanthropist - lots of Performance &amp; Presence, social out the wazoo, a respectable starting level of Influence and Resources. I don't think he'd spend any time in the circles the other characters described would be seen in, unless you think otherwise?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, organized crime saw the huge bucks HK films were raking in worldwide during the early 90s, and insinuated themselves into the industry, and by the time very late 90s they were pretty deeply enmeshed. They profited, but eventually they came to be strangling the studios, not just through taking their cut, but by things like <a href=\"https://books.google.com/books?id=YZxILInT83sC&amp;pg=PA106&amp;lpg=PA106&amp;dq=organized+crime+hong+kong+cinema&amp;source=bl&amp;ots=g_ICO_sbKT&amp;sig=shBAYRlVRlpkUfsvk80yhA_3_f8&amp;hl=en&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=0CBwQ6AEwADgKahUKEwiI4c38pfjHAhXGiw0KHR_0D5E#v=onepage&amp;q=organized%20crime%20hong%20kong%20cinema&amp;f=false\" target=\"_blank\"> murdering film producers, and forcing top stars to sign multi-film deals to do triad-backed projects</a>. So, there are underworld/motion picture crossover elements aplenty.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1536-39steps","name":"39Steps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T22:51:54-07:00","id":665404,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/648368-recruitment-for-exalted-modern?p=665069#post665069\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was thinking of being South Korean spec ops or something like it so maybe whatever drove you to America also drove me there. I'd say we've done missions together before, I'm sure we can randomly reveal what they were during game.</div> </div> </div> </div>SoKo Spec Ops (707th Special Missions Battalion?) sounds like a good idea from this end, as between Sherlockian investigator, a Charisma/ Performance entertainment superstar, and an underworld dealmaker with generous Socialize and Bureaucracy, we seem to be well represented in Social-fu situations. (I'm unsure of our runner's areas of focus).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1536-39steps","name":"39Steps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T23:02:16-07:00","id":665408,"title":"","content":"Since the ST said we were going to end up based in the United States due to his personal comfort, I'm coming from Hollywood and not the Hong Kong studios.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When one is accustomed to privilege, equality seems like oppression.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7195-tidygamer","name":"TidyGamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7195_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"644"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T23:15:47-07:00","id":665417,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TidyGamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/648368-recruitment-for-exalted-modern?p=665408#post665408\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since the ST said we were going to end up based in the United States due to his personal comfort, I'm coming from Hollywood and not the Hong Kong studios.</div> </div> </div> </div>*facepalms* Of course you are. I'm a dweeb. My only explanation is that I've never played a foreign national in a game set in our world, and I've been nose-to-book trying to get my research right. Well, that and I live in a city that's just under 50% Asian demographic (HK, Shanghai, Taiwan), and right next to a city that's over 60%, and I've been projecting blue lighting and the shadows of slow industial fans over everything, trying to imagine them as sites for a Woo-style Exalted shootout. So...I've got Hong Kong cinema on the brain?<br /> <br /> Also the stern nun you use for an avatar is very stern. Like if Ed Asner had become a Carmelite nun, sort of.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1536-39steps","name":"39Steps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-15T08:39:28-07:00","id":665785,"title":"","content":"Well honestly I could potentially run a game set in japan, but its been almost a decade since I lived there so my knowledge might be abit out of date. Suppose if you guys prefer and understand that I could manage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-15T09:16:52-07:00","id":665810,"title":"","content":"No, no... I'm good with the US. I knew that the game would be set here, I was just trying to nail my backstory down without too much handwaving down the road.<br /> <br /> Although, to be honest, you could set the game in Bikini Bottom or Pallet Town, and I'd be down to play.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1536-39steps","name":"39Steps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-15T09:57:55-07:00","id":665828,"title":"","content":"I'm good for either but I guess I'd rather the U.S. from sheer fact on how annoying the passiveness of the Japanese culture can get. Although since I'm using appearance as my main social stat that might be more useful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-15T10:56:06-07:00","id":665894,"title":"","content":"I'm fine with whatever, I'm sure a runner would work in either place, whether its just doing legit delivery (if via dangerous means) or if its running parcels for Yakuza or something. I have no intention of being evil. She's doing this cause its how her family can survive. (Something something money is tight, something most if not all goes to them something may lower resources to 1 to represent its all for them with minor amounts for her just to survive.) <br /> <br /> Also i believe that nun is from Dr. McNinja.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-15T13:39:36-07:00","id":666041,"title":"","content":"So this might be something borderline racist but what counts as a barbarian language and what counts as a full blown language? Obviously stuff like Navaho is but what about something vague like Swahili or the distinction between Chinese dialects and languages considering there's literally hundreds of them. Whomever was the eclipse might want to seriously consider the charm to communicate with people without knowing their language.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-15T14:22:38-07:00","id":666066,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/648368-recruitment-for-exalted-modern?p=665828#post665828\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm good for either but I guess I'd rather the U.S. from sheer fact on how annoying the passiveness of the Japanese culture can get. Although since I'm using appearance as my main social stat that might be more useful.</div> </div> </div> </div>Whoo Appearance bros! We're gonna be the prettiest Exalts on earth<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kell_Tamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/648368-recruitment-for-exalted-modern?p=665894#post665894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also i believe that nun is from Dr. McNinja.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah that's the look of a nun who's attempts to make a high school student shave his Mustache of Power have been thwarted.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When one is accustomed to privilege, equality seems like oppression.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7195-tidygamer","name":"TidyGamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7195_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"644"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-15T15:24:21-07:00","id":666110,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TidyGamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/648368-recruitment-for-exalted-modern?p=666066#post666066\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Whoo Appearance bros! We're gonna be the prettiest Exalts on earth<br /> <br /> <br /> Yeah that's the look of a nun who's attempts to make a high school student shave his Mustache of Power have been thwarted.</div> </div> </div> </div>And i shall be the one delivering the high fives between appearance bros.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-16T13:54:49-07:00","id":667406,"title":"","content":"If you guys have any quick questions fire them off now because I am leaving tomorrow morning and wont be back until monday","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-16T15:16:34-07:00","id":667511,"title":"","content":"What is the square footage of Rhode Island?<br /> <br /> <br /> In all seriousness, how much are you looking for as far as background? And can we get an official location for setting?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-16T15:19:12-07:00","id":667515,"title":"","content":"List format it is then.<br /> 1. Are Sidereals getting the exp discount thing that makes favored charms 9 non favored 11<br /> 2. Are artifacts completely off the table or can we get something minor or damaged under the guise of technology<br /> 3. Are you fine with me taking enemy 2 to represent a north Korean agent/spy I've run into before<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-16T16:13:51-07:00","id":667539,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kell_Tamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/648368-recruitment-for-exalted-modern?p=667511#post667511\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What is the square footage of Rhode Island?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>33,844,000,000sq feet<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kell_Tamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/648368-recruitment-for-exalted-modern?p=667511#post667511\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In all seriousness, how much are you looking for as far as background? And can we get an official location for setting?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm going with LA, it seems to fit everyone's background enough to justify a reason for being there. Keep backgrounds brief. A page at most.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/648368-recruitment-for-exalted-modern?p=667515#post667515\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">List format it is then.<br /> 1. Are Sidereals getting the exp discount thing that makes favored charms 9 non favored 11</div> </div> </div> </div>Whatever the exp chart is for 2.5e<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/648368-recruitment-for-exalted-modern?p=667515#post667515\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">List format it is then.<br /> 2. Are artifacts completely off the table or can we get something minor or damaged under the guise of technology</div> </div> </div> </div>For a sidereal? I'll consider you lucking into one but it would have to not only be a very minor artifact but something you cant definitively prove is supernatural. Not many artifacts like that.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/648368-recruitment-for-exalted-modern?p=667515#post667515\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3. Are you fine with me taking enemy 2 to represent a north Korean agent/spy I've run into before</div> </div> </div> </div>No merits or flaws. While I do enjoy them too often they are used to min/max.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-16T16:36:30-07:00","id":667600,"title":"","content":"1. Are starting Charms limited to those in the Core Rulebook and Shards, or are canon Charms from sources like GotMH also okay to start with?<br /> <br /> 2. Am I correct in assuming that I'm limited to Solar Charms at CharGen? Or might my Eclipsiness have let me learn something odd (but non-min/maxi)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1536-39steps","name":"39Steps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-16T16:37:50-07:00","id":667601,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/648368-recruitment-for-exalted-modern?p=666041#post666041\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Whomever was the eclipse might want to seriously consider the charm to communicate with people without knowing their language.</div> </div> </div> </div>Excellent Emmisary's Tongue. I'm on it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1536-39steps","name":"39Steps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-16T17:18:46-07:00","id":667624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>39Steps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/648368-recruitment-for-exalted-modern?p=667600#post667600\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1. Are starting Charms limited to those in the Core Rulebook and Shards, or are canon Charms from sources like GotMH also okay to start with?<br /> <br /> 2. Am I correct in assuming that I'm limited to Solar Charms at CharGen? Or might my Eclipsiness have let me learn something odd (but non-min/maxi)?</div> </div> </div> </div>Other charms are acceptable excluding ink monkies and glories of the first age due to many of them not being very balanced.<br /> <br /> Though you cannot start with non-solar charms","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-20T21:49:57-07:00","id":672881,"title":"","content":"ok guys I am back, and I mean I like JUST got back. So dont expect any real updates for abit but feel free to resume sending stuff in, asking questions, ect","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-21T00:44:52-07:00","id":672973,"title":"","content":"I'm curious in terms of meta how long the celestial exaltations have been running around doing stuff. Is this extremely recent or have there been small rumblings of some of them doing stuff. Also I will be referring to the dragon-blooded as reptiloids as they clearly are secretly controlling the world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-21T09:21:03-07:00","id":673249,"title":"","content":"Are you looking to start it this week? ( If so i might be late getting on, a friend of mine is coming by since we are prepping to head to grand rapids for a hacker convention on thursday the 8th of october) And furthermore, would there be any problem with me typing responses in? in which case i can multitask? (both for this thursday, and the thursday evening on the ride up on the 8th) These would probably be the only thursdays I have any issue with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-21T12:47:43-07:00","id":673354,"title":"","content":"Assuming this game isn't already full, playing a modern Dragon-blooded sounds fun.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2394-grifnir","name":"Grifnir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-21T17:12:28-07:00","id":673610,"title":"","content":"I for one are welcoming of reptiloids. I think we have room for you but until the ST says so, cross your fingers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-21T20:34:46-07:00","id":673822,"title":"","content":"I dont count spots filled until I get character sheets, and so far I'm pretty sure I only got two.<br /> <br /> I wont spoil too much but your past lives will tell you the shards haven't been active for a very long time. Its definitely a new thing but I don't want to give such an absolutist answer as them having been 100% gone.<br /> <br /> Oh and starting thursday is an option, and I know some people are excited, but it looks like alot of people still need to get their stuff in order. Perhaps we can do like a small session just to play test abit","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-22T10:45:32-07:00","id":674389,"title":"","content":"That could work. I was just worried about being the dragging wheel due to a prior engagement.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-23T17:34:41-07:00","id":675835,"title":"","content":"Due to the realization that any significant contribution I could make with a DB is likely already covered by the rest of the party in spades, it looks like my second choice is a far better fit. I am having a tough time coming up with a sufficient motivation for a celestial Exalt, however. Do you have any hints to some of the issues we might be aware of going into the first session? Alternatively, is it cool to have a more, 'figure out what the hell is going on' type of priority?<br /> <br /> EDIT: I PMed my character sheet to Praise the Sun. Aside from background details, the character should be all set.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":2394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2394-grifnir","user":"Grifnir","date":". 09-24-2015, 12:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2394-grifnir","name":"Grifnir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-24T09:45:53-07:00","id":676514,"title":"","content":"ok guys so if you PM me your skype I'll be holding a kind of meet and greet session tonight. This is not required, RPing may or may not be involved, and there will be no exp. Still if you'd like to try and get a feel for the group and me as a GM you are free to join","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-24T15:38:47-07:00","id":676899,"title":"","content":"Is there a shared online dice roller you prefer to use, or is a die-rolling app on, say, our phones (that we can hold up to the camera) all right? Are actual dice okay?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1536-39steps","name":"39Steps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-24T15:52:36-07:00","id":676932,"title":"","content":"ok, reminder, I only have two skype addresses from you guys, and one of them I already knew. So I need that info if you want to be in this pre-game session<br /> <br /> We aren't using cameras (atleast yet) and while I'd love to use actual dice I dont have any. I do know of a dice rolling program, I'll link everyone to it in chat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-27T14:45:56-07:00","id":680415,"title":"","content":"Was working on an idea to get things moving for you guys. It seems that if not in character than atleast out of character everyone is really interested in exploring what exactly is going on in the world to cause all this. So my idea was to have a NPC that informs and sends you guys one place or another to investigate. The idea was abit sour on me because of experiences with GMPCs, but I think we can manage this. The person will be mysterious and with connections but not directly involved beyond that. The role of the PC is not to order you but to direct the story (atleast to start) as to where points of interest might be. Plus him gathering everyone is an easy justification for all of you getting together","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-27T18:36:30-07:00","id":680573,"title":"","content":"works for me. i'll try to get a background to you tomorrow, had the nephews this weekend so I was a bit indisposed with keeping them entertained. Who knew raising a kid with more than an ipad and tv to entertain them would result in a kid with hobbies?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T01:32:33-07:00","id":680759,"title":"","content":"I don't think the equivalent of a Mr. Johnson in Exalted necessarily makes him a GM PC. We don't have to follow his orders to the letter or at all. He wouldn't make our actions irrelevant unless maybe we begged him to solve a problem (which I'm assuming would hurt said relationship). I'm curious what this &quot;Mr. Johnson&quot; and my mentor know of each other though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T04:21:55-07:00","id":680880,"title":"","content":"I agree with Eura-- having an expository/mission assignment NPC =/= a GM PC. The technique worked in Charlie's Angels, Quantum Leap and (with the new voice-acting) Destiny, and it could work here, too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1536-39steps","name":"39Steps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T21:27:16-07:00","id":681744,"title":"","content":"ok good. By the way I was considering removing virtue flaws. I have a narrative reason but its negotiable if you'd prefer to keep limit around","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7554-praise-the-sun","name":"Praise the Sun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T04:21:30-07:00","id":681913,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Praise the Sun</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/648368-recruitment-for-exalted-modern?p=681744#post681744\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">ok good. By the way I was considering removing virtue flaws. I have a narrative reason but its negotiable if you'd prefer to keep limit around</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, that's an unexpected bonus! You know, given the soul-deep <i>hate</i> that I see so many Forumites have for the concept of limit for even <i>daring to exist</i>, I'm halfway tempted to vote for keeping it, just to see the <i>Kingsmen</i>-style symphony of exploding heads that would surely follow. Unfortunately, I'm not always that much of a troll, so if my fellow players are OK with scotching Limit, then so am I.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1536-39steps","name":"39Steps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T07:52:00-07:00","id":682031,"title":"","content":"I'm fine with limit existing as long as the ST is fine with the extra work of having to actually make it interesting. The sidereal one is kind of boring so I'm fine either way. To be honest there's a couple hilarious lunar limit breaks though, especially hen mother. <br /> <br /> I know it's going to be a long time before this ever comes up but how are sidereal martial arts going to be handled? Most of the truly BS stuff is essence 6+ and the problem attainable charms can be fixed fairly easily (obsidian form might need a rework though since cheap PD's are a no no now), they're meant to be glass cannon stuff and trust me I've randomly one shot a sidereal martial artist because sorcery and they couldn't use duck fate because 2.0 combo rules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T11:08:32-07:00","id":682232,"title":"","content":"From my prior experience, it just feels like an unnecessary burden for the GM to track limit development and so on. As a person who feels like it detracts from, more than enhances the experience on a fundamental level, I am for tossing out limit.<br /> <br /> As an aside, I have been trying to make appropriate adjustments to my Lunar but everything feels rather bland and forced when taking a step back. I'm looking at tweeking an old journeys build and seeing if a sidereal wheelman toting a yoyo and finger point pistols will fit. Background is likely a drifter who lives off of interest from a time he scored big in Vegas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2394-grifnir","name":"Grifnir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T12:02:23-07:00","id":682259,"title":"","content":"Aw, I was kinda looking forward to a bunch of different exalts, but I know what you mean for lunars, they have quite a few charms that are solar but worse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T14:08:09-07:00","id":682336,"title":"","content":"Yeah I had literally nothing but excellencies, healing and war form. The ox body is nice but incredibly boring. The background was also a little hard to make relevant as well.<br /> <br /> For a sidereal, I find the journeys drifter to be more inherently fun both historically and potentially.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2394-grifnir","name":"Grifnir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T14:16:23-07:00","id":682343,"title":"","content":"Limit: Meh, whatever, I have never limit broke in a game before. The only time I saw it happen was when an ST did an insane dragon bloods crazy research on a captured anathema. He basically forced a character into limit break that way. <br /> <br /> Mixed exalts: Love it myself. I have played a DB in a game of A dawn, a dusk, a full moon, and a day, and I was the only one who actually got anything worthwhile done. Everyone else was so busy trying to put on the macho chest thumping who is the strongest one here, my air aspect breeding 1 outcast took the time to charm a few guildsman into owing us all Resources 3 rewards each and a voucher for one favor of resources 4 to be called in at a time of our choosing, if it was called in within one year it would be worth Resources 4, if it was after a year, Resources 5. we were originally going to be given R3 overall. (my character was still treated by the dawn types as being the inexperienced one who needed proper guidance from the Celestials, and needed to have CMA in order )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T14:34:27-07:00","id":682352,"title":"","content":"I'm ambivalent either way regarding discarding limit, so if people want to drop it that's cool.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When one is accustomed to privilege, equality seems like oppression.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7195-tidygamer","name":"TidyGamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7195_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"644"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T16:36:44-07:00","id":682431,"title":"","content":"Wait, you didn't go for any of the cool charms as a lunar? No wonder you were bored you went for every single meat and potato charm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T16:39:28-07:00","id":682432,"title":"","content":"I love lunar investigation charms. I really hope 3E does some neat stuff with being able to like smell where a per